{"about_the_game":"In the enchanted world of the Middle Ages, it's a king's struggle for survival! Equipped with top-down shooter mechanics and rogue-lite elements, you must battle against increasingly challenging waves of enemy swarms.<br><br>You'll encounter different maps and various foes, engaging in a great struggle. Your chosen abilities will determine your style of combat and fate.<br><br>Features <br>- Automatic firing weapons and spells are available.<br>- Games are short-lived, lasting less than 10 minutes.<br>- You can choose from 4 different characters, each with unique attributes.<br>- There are 9 item and ability options.<br>- Try to survive during waves lasting 10 minutes and eliminate as many enemies as possible.<br>- Gain experience points by destroying enemies. Level up to choose your own special abilities between attacks!<br>- As the level increases, the difficulty levels of the enemies will also increase.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734250/extras/2e1710b2a54b8412c85015145b9c42e5.poster.avif?t=1747619924\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734250/extras/2e1710b2a54b8412c85015145b9c42e5.webm?t=1747619924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734250/extras/2e1710b2a54b8412c85015145b9c42e5.mp4?t=1747619924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Meadowbrook Village","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2734250/474e7672b58a1f168148ccf656f0c29e89c492fa.jpg"},{"name":"Rivercross Haven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2734250/474e7672b58a1f168148ccf656f0c29e89c492fa.jpg"},{"name":"Moonshadow Castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st